# French lexicon: verb entries in u (docs/LEXICON_FORMAT_FR.md), written from own knowledge (clean-room).
ulcérer verb
ululer verb pp_inv note=elides; the h- spelling hululer is aspirate
unifier verb
uniformiser verb
unir verb class=ir
urbaniser verb
urger verb impersonal pp_inv style=colloquial
uriner verb
user verb
usiner verb
usurper verb
utiliser verb
